 ],
 "strings": {
  "First you offered 10 mil for a hit, and now\nyou wanna pay 100 just to kidnap them?": "",
  "Heh. Funny you should ask that.": "",
  "Ah, about that...": "",
  "It could very well end up being more than just \"a few guys.\"\nWe're not quite sure how many we might want.": "",
  "The problem is that we don't know\nhow many people we're going to need abducted.": "",
  "Perhaps just one...\nOr maybe even ten might not be satisfactory.": "",
  "One might do the trick,\nor maybe ten might be too few.": "",
  "Ten, huh?": "",
  "Ten...?": "",
  "The key point is,\nwe expect this to be a long-term partnership.": "",
  "In other words,\nwe see this as a long-term partnership.": "",
  "Given the sensitive nature of this task,\nnaturally we expect the utmost secrecy.": "",
  "As we are being rather open about this,\nwe'll need to ensure your silence.": "",
  "I sincerely hope this 100 million\nconveys the importance of that.": "",
  "An amount like this\nshould cover that, I presume.": "",
  "What about the Kyorei guys?\nWhat happens to them, huh?": "",
  "What happens to the\nKyorei Clan guys we give you?": "",
  "It's unfortunately likely\nthat they'll end up dead.": "",
  "It's likely that they'll end up dead.": "",
  "Excuse me if this is presumptuous...\nBut considering the amount I'm offering...\n": "",
  "I hope this isn't an imposition,\nbut would 100 million also cover body disposal?": "",
  "Would that also cover the body disposal?": "",
  "If not...": "",
  "Or would that... Cost extra?": "",
  "Is that extra?": "",
  "Drop the fucking act, asshole!": "",
  "I've had about enough\nof this little game!": "",
  "Where are you gettin'\nthat kinda money, huh!?": "",
  "100 mil just to kill\none goddamn yakuza!?": "",
  "100 mil just to kill a single yakuza?": "",
  "I actually never said\nyou needed to kill anyone.": "",
  "I'm not asking you to kill anyone.": "",
  "I only requested that\nyou bring them to us.": "",
  "I'm asking you to abduct them.　": "",
  "And then...\nYou would just dispose of the evidence.": "",
  "And afterward, dispose of the bodies.": "",
  "I don't see where this is going!": "",
  "What's at the finish line here!?": "",
  "You think the yakuza are your tool?": "",
  "You think you can\nfuck with the yakuza!?": "",
  "You don't understand.\nMy only role is delivering the message.": "",
  "I'm nothing more than a messenger!": "",
  "My employer, he's the root of all this.\nAnd...": "",
  "But numbers like this\ndon't phase my employer...": "",
  "You have no idea how many billions of yen he has\nto ensure his objectives are achieved.": "",
  "I assure you, they can move\nmillions around as they please.": "",
  "If you pull that trigger right now...\nWho knows how decisive the retribution might be.": "",
  "You can kill me,\nbut if they determine that you're a threat...": "",
  "Those billions could instead\nbe shifted toward erasing you.": "",
  "...They'd put a number of\nsimilar proportion on your head.": "",
  "Just think about it.\nHow long will you be able to survive?": "",
  "And when that day comes...\nHow long do you think you'll last?": "",
  "Use your head, Captain Hamura.": "",
  "Let that sink in.": "",
  "There's no escape.": "",
  "Refusal isn't an option anymore.": "",
  "Once you agreed to meet with me today, you all but\nguaranteed your participation and your compliance.": "",
  "Now that we've discussed the terms,\nyou're more or less locked in.": "",
  "So I strongly suggest\nyou put the gun away.": "",
  "So let's start by lowering the gun...": "",
  "Does that make sense?": "",
  "Captain Hamura.": "",
  "You guys are seriously that big, huh?": "",
  "Your organization is that big, huh?": "",
  "Tell me more. Talk.": "",
  "Just who the hell are you?": "",
  "Allow me to answer your question.\nIt's true that we have access to vast amounts of money, yes.": "",
  "Our organization prefers\nto avoid violence...": "",
  "But we're not the violent\norganization you think we are.": "",
  "But it comes with the\nterritory of a blank check.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Who're you?": "",
  "Ishimatsu's superior.\nThe name's Ichinose.": "",
  "I'm Ishimatsu's superior.\nMy name is Ichinose.": "",
  "The only reason I'm choosing to show you my face...\nIs because I've decided to trust you.": "",
  "I'm only showing you my face\nbecause I'm deciding to trust you.": "",
  "Because I want you to understand how far we're\nwilling to go to bring our plan to fruition.": "",
  "Because I want you to understand\nthat we're risking our lives here too.": "",
  "My name's... Shono, Captain.": "",
  "My name is Shono.": "",
  "I'm currently researching a brand-new\ndrug called AD-9...": "",
  "I'm developing a new drug called AD-9.": "",
  "A drug that could very well save Japan.\nOr... Or maybe even the world—": "",
  "It's going to save the country...\nNo! The world is—": "",
  "A new drug, huh?\nWhere do I come in?": "",
  "Developing... drugs?": "",
  "The reality of the situation is, we are under\nintense pressure to complete our work on AD-9 expediently.": "",
  "AD-9 is a dream that must\ncome to fruition with all haste.": "",
  "To that end, Hamura-san...": "",
  "Hamura-san.": "",
  "We'd like to ask for your assistance.": "",
  "To that end,\nwe need someone of your talents.": "",
  "Face it.\nAyabe's alibi isn't gonna hold water.": "",
  "Ayabe doesn't have\nan alibi that'll stick.": "",
  "The guy doesn't even remember\nwho attacked him? Right.": "",
  "I can't remember who attacked me?": "",
  "Nobody'll buy that. Never.": "",
  "Who the hell would believe that?": "",
  "Fair enough. Although...": "",
  "Fair enough, but...": "",
  "What if we caught the Mole?\nAnd then forced you to testify in the trial.": "",
  "If we caught the Mole,\nand you testified against him...": "",
  "What was that?\nWhat's wrong?": "",
  "What is it?\nWhat's going on?": "",
  "Smells like... Something's burning.": "",
  "I smell something burning.": "",
  "My boys must've finally\ndecided to show up.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family\nis here to get me out.": "",
  "You really wanna meet the Mole?\nNow's your chance.": "",
  "The Mole may even be here.": "",
  "Matsugane-san. We gotta go.": "",
  "Sir, we need to get out of here.": "",
  "You too. Get up.": "",
  "Stand up, Hamura.": "",
  "I'm gonna go ahead and suggest\nyou let me walk away, Boss.": "",
  "I'd say it's in your best interest\nto let me go, boss.": "",
  "If I give the order,\nthe family will fall back.": "",
  "I can call the Matsugane Family off.": "",
  "Least then, you'd live.\nIsn't that what you want?": "",
  "That's the only way\nyou're gonna live through this.": "",
  "That's enough.": "",
  "If this Ministry of Health business is true,\nyou're nothing more than a pawn to them.": "",
  "If what you said earlier is true,\nyou're just a disposable pawn to them.": "",
  "From where they stand,\nI'm sure you can be replaced.": "",
  "I'm sure they could replace\nyou in a heartbeat.": "",
  "Oh, I don't know about that.": "",
  "I don't know about that.": "",
  "You're an idiot... Hamura.": "",
  "You're really that stupid, huh?": "",
  "Come on.": "",
  "Let's go!": "",
  "It's the Matsugane!\nThey went n' started a fire downstairs.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family started\na fire downstairs!": "",
  "Hehe. I've been waitin' for this!": "",
  "This oughta be good!": "",
  "Oh, Murase. How many they got?": "",
  "Murase! How many we lookin' at!?": "",
  "Captain!!!": "",
  "That's it. They're so fucking dead!": "",
  "Now they've fuckin' done it...": "",
  "How did you pull off turning\nmy family into goddamn terrorists?": "",
  "When did the family get so radicalized?": "",
  "Yo! Let's crack some heads!": "",
  "All right! Fuck 'em up!": "",
  "Son of a...": "",
  "Fuckin' a...": "",
  "Captain! You okay!?": "",
  "Matsugane-san...": "",
  "Oh fuck...": "",
  "You...!": "",
  "Is that...\nIs that the Mole?": "",
  "That's... the Mole!?": "",
  "Don't!": "",
  "Hold on!": "",
  "...Sir!": "",
  "What the fuck man!?": "",
  "Who the hell!?": "",
  "Break this asshole!": "",
  "Motherfucker!": "",
  "Boss... Why...\nWhy did you...": "",
  "Boss... Wh-Why?": "",
  "After all I did...": "",
  "Why would you do that!?": "",
  "So that was...\nthe Mole, right?": "",
  "That was... the Mole, right?": "",
  "I would've done the... the same if I was him.\nYou knew too much.": "",
  "If I were him,\nthe first thing I'd do is put you down...": "",
  "I... wish I wasn't right.": "",
  "I told you so...": "",
  "You're too damn soft.": "",
  "I'm not talking about that!": "",
  "You didn't...\nYou didn't have to protect me.": "",
  "Why did you shield me!?": "",
  "When I heard what you said...": "",
  "When I heard you say it...　": "",
  "I knew you were right.": "",
  "I understood.　": "",
  "This is all...": "",
  "That the fault...": "",
  "my fault.": "",
  "...Was mine.　": "",
  "No, it's not!": "",
  "I wasn't... very good at the business side...": "",
  "You couldn't count on me to lead, so...": "",
  "And because of that... you had to protect the family...\nby crossing the line...": "",
  "You crossed that bridge...\nto protect the family...": "",
  "There were signs, of course...\nI wasn't ignorant...": "",
  "I think I knew deep down...": "",
  "I... I looked the other way...": "",
  "But it was easier to pretend I didn't.": "",
  "And just... never asked where the money came from...\nIt was easier that way.": "",
  "And just let you keep earning...": "",
  "I'm not going to... blame you\nfor... for all of that.": "",
  "I have no right to complain now...": "",
  "You just did...": "",
  "Was it hard on you?": "",
  "...what you had to.": "",
  "I'm really...": "",
  "I'm sorry.": "",
  "Sorry.": "",
  "No, not like this...": "",
  "Boss! It's...": "",
  "Don't go...": "",
  "So this is...": "",
  "I wanted to... I wanted to... to make up for...\nIt was the... the only way...": "",
  "All I can do... to make it right.　": "",
  "You old fool...\nYou didn't need to go that far...": "",
  "You never had to\nown up for that...": "",
  "I only did... what any father would have.": "",
  "All part... of being a parent.": "",
  "Boss!": "",
  "Just hold on!": "",
  "Tak, my boy...": "",
  "My boy...!": "",
  "This is... it for me...": "",
  "I'm fading out.　": "",
  "Hurry and... get out...": "",
  "Hurry. Get out...!": "",
  "Not without you.": "",
  "What are you saying!?　": "",
  "Come on!": "",
  "The Mole is Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Kuroiwa from Kamurocho PD!": "",
  "Now you know the truth.\n": "",
  "He's the Mole.": "",
  "Kuroiwa's the one you want!": "",
  "Kuroiwa is the Mole!": "",
  "You had yourself one helluva night,\nhuh Yagami.": "",
  "Pretty rough night, Yagami?": "",
  "Doesn't seem like it's\nending anytime soon.": "",
  "I get the feeling it's not over yet?": "",
  "Could you at least take these off?": "",
  "Mind taking these off?": "",
  "Or am I gonna get booked?": "",
  "Or am I under arrest?": "",
  "Afraid I can't. Wouldn't you know,\nsomeone went and lost the key.": "",
  "Sorry.\nI have no idea where the key is.": "",
  "Hamura told me everything.": "",
  "Told you what?": "",
  "About?": "",
  "Told me who you really are.": "",
  "Your other identity.": "",
  "You killed Vice Director Hashiki.": "",
  "You killed the ADDC's vice-director?": "",
  "You mutilated those yakuza.": "",
  "Gouged those yakuza's eyes out...": "",
  "And Shintani's all you too.": "",
  "Then you killed Shintani...": "",
  "I'm on to you.": "",
  "It was all you.": "",
  "Well, that's a good story.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
